SUMMARY:Once Upon a One More Time
DESCRIPTION:Powered by the chart-topping hits of the undisputed Princess of Pop\, Once Upon A One More Time turns our favorite fairytales upside down with a clever twist! When a fairy godmother goes rogue and plops copies of The Feminine Mystique in the laps of classic heroines\, the damsels embark on a quest to rewrite their stories and redefine “happily ever after.”  \nPerformed by Theatre Raleigh ACT Performance Company students
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/once-upon-a-one-more-time/2026-09-26/
LOCATION:De Ann S. Jones Theatre at Theatre Raleigh Arts Center\, 6638 Old Wake Forest Road\, Raleigh
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/onceuponaobemoretime.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Theatre Raleigh":MAILTO:info@theatreraleigh.com
END:VEVENT
